# Manual tests

The manual layer of this service's test suite, beside the automated specs.
Everything here is driven by a human (or a chauffeur script) against a running
instance — the edges no headless run can judge: layout, focus, printouts, live
reactivity across two sessions, degraded modes, and exploratory pokes.

**Suites and rounds are separate things.** The files under [`suites/`](suites)
are the tests: evergreen, re-runnable, and **never ticked in place**.
[`runs/`](runs) is the history: one record per round. A suite never names a
round; a record is never a test.

